    "## Quick Reference\n",
    "\n",
    "A list comprehension:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "[expression for item in iterable]\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "A filtered comprehension:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "[expression for item in iterable if condition]\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "A dictionary comprehension:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "{key: value for item in iterable}\n",
    "```"
