   "source": [
    "## Exercise 1: Square numbers\n",
    "\n",
    "Create a list containing the square of every number in `numbers`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n",
    "\n",
    "# TODO: Create squares using a list comprehension\n",
    "squares = []\n",
    "\n",
    "squares"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Solution\n",
    "squares = [number ** 2 for number in numbers]\n",
    "squares"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Exercise 2: Filter even numbers\n",
    "\n",
    "Create a list containing only the even numbers from 1 through 20."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "numbers = list(range(1, 21))\n",
    "\n",
    "# TODO: Keep only even numbers\n",
    "even_numbers = []\n",
    "\n",
    "even_numbers"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
