   "source": [
    "## Exercise 4: Conditional expressions\n",
    "\n",
    "Label each number as `\"even\"` or `\"odd\"`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Expected result:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "[\"odd\", \"even\", \"odd\", \"even\", \"odd\"]\n",
