    "## Challenge\n",
    "\n",
    "Rewrite this loop as a dictionary comprehension:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "result = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "for number in range(1, 11):\n",
    "    if number % 2 == 0:\n",
    "        result[number] = number ** 2\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Expected result:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "{2: 4, 4: 16, 6: 36, 8: 64, 10: 100}\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# TODO: Rewrite the loop as a dictionary comprehension\n",
    "result = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "result"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Solution\n",
    "result = {\n",
    "    number: number ** 2\n",
    "    for number in range(1, 11)\n",
    "    if number % 2 == 0\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "result"
   ]
